## To graph (n: Int) -> (Set of (Text, Text), Set of Text):
    Let edges be a new Set of (Text, Text).
    Let nodes be a new Set of Text.
    Repeat for i from 1 to n:
        Add ("n{i}", "n{i + 1}") to edges.
        Add "n{i}" to nodes.
    Return (edges, nodes).

## Main
Let (es, ns) be graph(3).
Show es contains ("n2", "n3").
Show es contains ("n3", "n2").
Show the count of ns.
Repeat for (a, b) in es:
    Show a + " to " + b.
